    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "reaction",
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dragon is targeted with an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon raises a wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the dragon is Flying, they descend 10 feet after the attack.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Wing Deflection",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": "The dragon is targeted with an attack"
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>If the next action the dragon uses is Breath Weapon, the magma clings to those it damages. Each creature that fails its save against the Breath Weapon takes @Damage[4d6[persistent,fire]] damage, and as long as it has this persistent fire damage, it also takes a -10-foot status penalty to its Speeds.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Volcanic Purge",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a blast of magma that deals @Damage[9d6[fire],4d12[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage]{9d6 fire damage and 4d12 bludgeoning damage} in a @Template[cone|distance:40] (@Check[reflex|dc:33|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>\n<p>They can't use Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Breath Weapon",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "fire",
        "primal"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
